      "text": "WHEREAS, certain itemized information and supporting schedules of appropriations, as last modified as of March 15, 1968, were contained in the Mayor's 1968-1969 Budget message, in accordance with Section 117 (b) 2 of the New York City Charter, and it is necessary to provide for certain actions taken subsequent to March 15, 1968,",
